# Who is the barmaid? Manet's A Bar at the Folies-Bergère
tags: ["art history","manet","impressionism","19th century paris","social class","labor"]
teaches: ["art-history/painting-interpretation","social-history/urban-labor","visual-analysis/composition-and-mirror"]
voices: {"a":"gemini:Charon | a warm, unhurried gallery guide, quietly amused"}
prompt: "Who is she, and what is she selling? What does her face say that the crowd behind her doesn't?"
